    "title": "Stephens, Weinreich, Smith No. 1 in latest IAWrestle rankings - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Trevor Maeder ,\n8 hours ago (KMAland) -- Three KMAland girls wrestlers are ranked No. 1 in the latest IAWrestle rankings. Those honors go to Clarinda’s Lily Weinreich (1A-140), Lewis Central’s Avaeh Smith (2A-125) and Ellexis Stephens (2A-130). View the full rankings here (subscription required) and list of ranked KMAlanders below. CLASS 1A. Team. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
